{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56763","headline":"滕庭俊遇麻大和且耶作诗（题拟） · 不详","name":"滕庭俊遇麻大和且耶作诗（题拟）","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"田文称好客，凡养几多人。\n如欠冯谖在，今希厕下宾。\n（以上二题见《太平广记》卷四七四引牛僧孺《玄怪录》）（按：麻大、和且耶爲大苍蝇、秃扫帚。\n《全唐诗》卷八六七已收二怪诗及故事梗概。\n）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"不详","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_56763.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_56763","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}